{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"つーうーがーくーでーんしゃーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どもっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございまするヽ(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/9150721/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかよしちーむN"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな変身したいもの教えてくれてありがとうございました(*´˘`*)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スポーツ選手とかいいな‼\nって書いてる方いて\nあーいいかもー‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思ってたら\n能力とかはつかないんだっけ⁇\nってゆうコメントきてわお\nってなったりしました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂メンバーになりたい‼\n結構多かったね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/9150721/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなかでも\nなんか\nちはるんになりたーい‼\nとか\nちはるんの周りの人になって一緒にいたーい‼\nとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて嬉しいこと言ってくれるの(´;ω;`)(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/9150721/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/05/9150721/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶわあ（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分がなりたいものねー( ˙³˙)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかすごくすごく難しくて\nいっぱい考えちゃったよ‼笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊キューピットちゃん\n＊女警察官\n＊きままな猫\n＊国内問わずモデルさん\n＊売れっ子女優さん\n＊歌手のみなさん\n＊才色兼備\n＊獣医さん\n＊歴史上の人々\n＊海とか空"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text